      "bbox": [
        400,
        449,
        1227,
        562
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Whereas, It is necessary to coordinate computer system development in The City of New York in order to provide for the development of systems at least cost which will improve agency operations, service levels and management information and these systems have common applicability to more than one agency or require data which is collected by more than one agency; and it is necessary that the City develop and maintain a coordinated plan for the effective and efficient use of information systems and insure that agency plans are consistent with this plan.",
