        599,
        1227,
        692
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Section 1. There is hereby created in the office of the Mayor an Office of Computer Plans and Controls to be headed by the Director of Operations which will insure the elimination of duplicate effort, the efficient use of computer resources and the development of state of the art systems responsive to the requirements of the City. It shall have the following functions and duties:",
      "logprob_stats": {
